        "quote": "(a) The Chief of Police is hereby authorized and directed to establish a program to utilize volunteers to survey parking lots in the City for the purpose of photographing motor vehicles parked in violation of Standard Traffic Ordinance Sections 87 and 87a, and the provisions of this article, and any amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.310:block:0#text",
